{"ref":"BDB, עֶגְלוֹן","hw":"עֶגְלוֹן","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֶגְלוֹן</span></big><sub>13</sub>  <strong>n.pr. (</strong>cf. Gray<sup>Prop. N. 92, No. 27</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br>†<strong>1.</strong>  <strong> m.</strong> a king of Moab, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:12\" href=\"/Judges.3.12\">Ju 3:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:14\" href=\"/Judges.3.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:15\" href=\"/Judges.3.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:17\" href=\"/Judges.3.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, 𝔊 Εγλωμ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> loc.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:3\" href=\"/Joshua.10.3\">Jos 10:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:5\" href=\"/Joshua.10.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:23\" href=\"/Joshua.10.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:37\" href=\"/Joshua.10.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:12\" href=\"/Joshua.12.12\">12:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:34\" href=\"/Joshua.15.34\">15:34</a>, c. ה loc. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:34\" href=\"/Joshua.10.34\">10:34</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעֶגְלוֹ֫נָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:36\" href=\"/Joshua.10.36\">36</a>; 𝔊 Οδολλαμ <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10\" href=\"/Joshua.10\">Jos 10</a>; Αιλαμ <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:12\" href=\"/Joshua.12.12\">12:12</a>, A Εγλωμ, 𝔊L Εγλων, and so <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:39\" href=\"/Joshua.15.39\">15:39</a>; site <em>ʿAǧlân</em>, N. of <em>Telel-Ḥesy</em>, Buhl<sup>Geogr. 192</sup>.","next":"BDB, עֶגְלַ֫יִם","prev":"BDB, עָגִיל"}